    "cuota = base × % (4 % producto, 21 % envases; redondeo 2 decimales)",
    "Total factura = Total neto + cuota 4 % + cuota 21 %. Comprobado: R608 477,48 + 19,17 − 0,35 = 496,30; R340 581,33 + 23,65 − 2,08 = 602,90; R1096 285,96 + 11,44 = 297,40; R2 6,60 + 1,39 = 7,99",
